// What stacked affixes are worth. One of three files identical but for the
// weapon's `affixes` row: no affix at all — the baseline every other file here is read against.
//
// The same affix four times on purpose. Affix stats are added to the item's
// **base** before every scaling axis, so four of one isolates the stacking
// from which affixes happened to be picked — a mixed set would measure the
// pool as much as the mechanic.
//
// `equip` is **top-level**, not inside `Fresh(...)` — a row in the wrong
// place is ignored silently, and identical numbers across a sweep read as a
// dead feature rather than an unread input.
//
// Read the three together and only within one build: an arena absolute moves
// with any RNG-stream shift, so the deltas are the readable figure.
(
    player: Fresh(level: 12, zone: 3),
    equip: [
        (item: "arc_lance", affixes: []),
    ],
    party: [
        (species: "scrapper", level: 12),
    ],
    opponents: [(species: "rootkit", count: 4)],
    reps: 30,
    seed: 7,
)
